cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use INNLI or its datasets in research, please cite it as below."
title: "INNLI: an open agent gateway for independent accommodations"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "The INNLI authors"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-19"
license: AGPL-3.0-only
keywords:
  - AI agents
  - Model Context Protocol
  - hospitality
  - prompt injection
  - federated directory
abstract: >-
  Open-source software that lets AI agents find and book small independent
  accommodations honestly (host-confirmed facts), safely (prompt-injection
  guard, consent hashes, signed passports) and efficiently (lean tool profile,
  next actions), through a self-hosted installation and a free federated guide.
